Z||000016||msweldon||12-14-2000||01:10 PM||||Terry,<P>Would the "How to rebuild a GM 60* V6" be an adequate source on the 3.4TDC or does that book only cover the PR engines?  I considering the latter since I think the last publication of that book was 91 or 92.<P>thanks,<BR>mw||||reg||1
Z||000017||terryk||12-14-2000||02:51 PM||||My edition doesn't have the DOHC in it. Maybe a later edition does, but I doubt it.<P><p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 12-14-2000).]||||reg||1
